{
  "slug": "opensearch-agent-skills",
  "name": "Opensearch Agent Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A collection of Agent Skills for building search applications and analyzing observability data with OpenSearch. Works with Claude Code, Cursor, Kiro, and any agent that supports the Agent Skills standard.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `opensearch-skills` (Build search applications and query log analytics data with OpenSearch).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install opensearch-agent-skills@claude-community` from `opensearch-project/opensearch-agent-skills`.\n\nA collection of Agent Skills for building search applications and analyzing observability data with OpenSearch. Works with Claude Code, Cursor, Kiro, and any agent that supports the Agent Skills standard.",
